For picking a random index into your board you need to use 
random.nextInt(board.length)
.


Notice that we only decrease 
remainingElements
 when a number is picked and printed, not every time through the loop. This causes the loop to repeat more times than there are elements in the 
board
 array. Eventually the random index will also pick the last remaining elements, 
remainingElements
 will be decreased to 0 and the loop will terminate.

