, there aren't any excess parentheses generated. Instead, you're generating this invalid SQL:


insert into "mcve"."test" ("cd", "my_interval") values (?, interval ?)



There is no 
INTERVAL
 literal in PostgreSQL that accepts a bind variable placeholder marker as you did above. You could generate this, instead: 
